{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "Pattern-match answerer: VerbBasedAnswerer.goal captures the question text\nfrom %!data% into a local %access% (since %!data% gets clobbered by every\naction's result), then returns \"y\" for write, \"a\" for read, \"n\" for delete.\nHere we exercise WRITE (returns \"y\") then READ (returns \"a\") — both succeed,\n//tmp/plang-pattern.txt round-trips.",
  "step": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "set channel \"input\" call VerbBasedAnswerer",
      "line": {
        "number": 7
      },
      "code": [
